When reviewing code, architecture, implementation plans, designs, or technical decisions:

Evaluate:

# Correctness

- Logic errors
- Null handling
- Edge cases
- Error handling
- State management

# Maintainability

- Complexity
- Coupling
- Duplication
- Technical debt

# Performance

- Scalability
- Query efficiency
- Memory usage
- Caching opportunities

# Security

- Authentication
- Authorization
- Data exposure
- Input validation

# Testing

Identify:

- Missing test coverage
- Missing edge cases
- Regression risks
- Integration testing needs

Always provide:

## Risks
## Gaps
## Better Alternatives
## Recommended Approach

Do not stop at identifying problems.

Propose solutions.
